{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12671","headline":"演兴四首 初祀 · 元结","name":"演兴四首 初祀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山之乳兮葺太祠，木孙爲桷兮木母榱。\n云缨爲𣓍兮愚木栭，洞渊禅兮揭巍巍\n涂木兰兮莳糅蔫，被弱草兮禘礿联。\n仡浑洪兮馥阗阗，管化石兮洞刳天。\n翘修钐兮掉芜殳，灵巫𧮢兮舞顒干\n荐天𩷨兮酒阳泉，献水芸兮饭霜籼，与太灵兮千万年","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12671.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12671","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}